<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38326" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang on</i> or <i>over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβους τοῖς ἀκροωμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.175
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισὶν ὀχλήσεις</span>
				Polystr.<i><span class="en">
				p.30
			</span></i> W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρίαν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					7.15
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, lit., <i>hang upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1337
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>hang over, impend,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσοῦτος ἐπήρτηται φόβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.140
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλλαγὴν τῶν ἐπηρτημένων φόβων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					18.324
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγών τινι -ημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.3.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνδυνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.151
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cyzicus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1027.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπηρτημένον [τοῦ ζυγοῦ</span>]
				<i>the elevated part</i> of the beam, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				850a23
			</span></i>.</div>
